OL,3,GNEWSAFive-month roadworks planned for
OL,4,Abusy junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive months of roadworks will begin
OL,7,Fsoon to install traffic lights on a
OL,8,Fbusy Lincoln junction.
OL,10,FThe Doddington Road and Birchwood
OL,11,FAvenue junction will be upgraded to
OL,12,Fincrease road capacity and reduce
OL,13,Fcongestion.
OL,15,FThe work is being done to meet future
OL,16,Fdemand from the City of Lincoln
OL,17,FCouncil's Charterholme house-building
OL,18,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
