OL,3,GNEWSAFive-month roadworks planned for
OL,4,Abusy junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemporary signals and diversion routes
OL,7,Fwill be put in place from 5 October,
OL,8,Fwith the work expected to be completed
OL,9,Fby the end of March 2027.
